---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../../data/site';
import { experiences, experienceGroups } from '../../data/experiences';
---
<SiteLayout title="Experiences" description="Thirteen invitations to discover Immortals Macau, from a hosted challenge to a personal assessment and an ongoing relationship." active="experiences">
<section class="wrap page-heading"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url()}>Macau flagship</a><span>/</span><span>Experiences</span></div><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE INVITATION</p><div class="page-heading-grid"><h1>Curiosity first.<br /><span>Something personal<br />follows.</span></h1><div><p>An experience gives a guest a reason to cross the threshold. What happens next should feel relevant, considered and entirely their choice.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="#collection">Explore the collection <span>↓</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap style-hero"><div class="experience-feature"><img src={url('assets/experiences/beat-the-dealer.webp')} alt="A host guides a guest through a challenge at an Immortals experience table." width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="experience-feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE INTERACTIVE SHOWCASE / EXPERIENCE 01</p><h2>Beat the<br />Dealer.</h2><p>Three challenges. Win two. A paid, hosted encounter turns reactions, grip and balance into the start of a conversation.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button solid" href={url('experiences/beat-the-dealer/')}>Discover the experience <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={url('experiences/beat-the-dealer/#play')}>Try the three-round demo <span>↗</span></a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cream"><div class="wrap section"><div class="chapter-line"><span>WHY EXPERIENCES?</span><span>AN OPEN DOOR TO THE CLINIC</span></div><div class="vision-grid"><h2>Make the first<br />step worth taking.</h2><div><p>A short stay leaves little room for a complicated invitation. An experience makes the proposition immediate: here is what you will do, why it is interesting and what you will take away.</p><p>It also creates a natural point of connection. A host can turn a moment of curiosity into a useful question, then help the guest decide whether to explore further.</p></div></div><div class="pillars"><article class="pillar"><span>01</span><h3>Invitation.</h3><p>Something understandable and memorable, designed to fit around a visitor’s time in Macau.</p></article><article class="pillar"><span>02</span><h3>Personal value.</h3><p>A record, a reflection or a practical idea. Every experience should give the guest something meaningful in its own right.</p></article><article class="pillar"><span>03</span><h3>Continuity.</h3><p>A relevant next step after the visit. Further assessment, follow-up and membership remain an individual choice.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section" id="collection"><div class="chapter-line"><span>THE EXPERIENCE COLLECTION</span><span>13 CONCEPTS / DIFFERENT WAYS IN</span></div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Choose your<br />first encounter.</h2><p>Some begin with play. Others with a quiet moment or a closer look at yourself. Each page follows the guest journey, the takeaway and the conversation it could open.</p></div>{experienceGroups.map((group,index)=><section class="experience-group"><div class="experience-group-heading"><h3>{group}</h3><span>0{index+1} / {experiences.filter(e=>e.group===group).length} CONCEPTS</span></div><div class="experience-cards">{experiences.filter(e=>e.group===group).map(e=><a class="experience-card" href={url(`experiences/${e.slug}/`)}><div class="experience-card-top"><span>{e.number} / IMMORTALS</span>{e.status!=='Experience concept'&&<span class="status-tag">{e.status}</span>}</div><h3>{e.name}</h3><p>{e.summary}</p><span>Discover the experience <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></a>)}</div></section>)}<p class="fine" style="margin-top:35px">An experience collection for discussion, rather than a confirmed service menu. Beat the Dealer has paid entry confirmed; other commercial terms and operating details remain to be developed. Concepts marked “Feasibility review” need further validation before becoming a guest offer.</p></section>
<section class="closing cream"><p class="eyebrow">THE EXPERIENCE NEEDS A SETTING</p><h2>A public invitation.<br />A private world beyond.</h2><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={url('layout/')}>See how the clinic fits together <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
